<cem:description lang="en">This lesson: "John Comes Home for a Visit" belongs to Elementary (A2.2). It is composed of twelve learning objects, that have the following learning outcomes: identify ways of improving aspects of communication in English based on the learning outcomes for level A2; describe characteristics of different people and their jobs; identify and describe plans for the organization of events; describe rooms, homes and objects in buildings in common social and work situations. On the other hand, the communicative functions of this lesson are: tell stories and anecdotes; discuss jobs and work.</cem:description>
</cem:resource>
